    "Name": "Catapult",
    "Details": "An upgrade of the prototype K3, this variant carries twin Heavy PPCs and ER medium lasers, along with seventeen double heat sinks, which do an admirable job keeping heat levels down. It also carries a C3 slave unit to share targeting telemetry. Built on a standard internal structure and using twelve and a half tons of Light Ferro-Fibrous armor, the designers were forced to use a downgraded Magna 195 fusion engine instead of the normal 260, giving this design a top speed of 56 km/h and reduced jumping capacity.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Energy</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.09</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
